{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_garen": {
        "name": "盖伦",
        "attack": "普攻造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>致命打击<>：盖伦获得<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>35% 移动速度<>，持续<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>。<#ffb900ff>4.5秒<>内的下一次普攻变为跃起重击，造成<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>并<#ef5350ff>沉默<>目标<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>。同时获得<#ff9028ff>勇气<>：<#ffb900ff>2秒<>内受到的伤害降低<#ffb900ff>30%<>、韧性提高<#ffb900ff>60%<>，并获得<#e8d44dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>6% 最大生命值<>的<#e8d44dff>护盾<>。",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>审判<>：盖伦挥剑旋转<#ffb900ff>3秒<>，可以边转边移动，共转<#ffb900ff>7<>圈，每圈对周围敌人造成<#ff9028ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>32% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。第<#ffb900ff>7<>圈命中的敌人<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>护甲<>降低<#ffb900ff>25%<>，持续<#ffb900ff>4秒<>。被动 <#ff9028ff>坚韧<>：盖伦拥有很高的<#6aff55ff>生命回复<>。",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>德玛西亚正义<>：召唤巨剑从天而降，对目标敌方英雄造成<#f5f5f5ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120% 攻击力<> + <#f5f5f5ff>12% 目标最大生命值<>的<#f5f5f5ff>真实伤害<>。"
      }
    },
    "skill_name": {
      "league_garen": {
        "skill1": "致命打击",
        "skill2": "审判",
        "ult": "德玛西亚正义"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_garen": {
        "name": "蓋倫",
        "attack": "普攻造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% 攻擊力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>。",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>致命打擊<>：蓋倫獲得<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>35% 移動速度<>，持續<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>。<#ffb900ff>4.5秒<>內的下一次普攻變為躍起重擊，造成<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150% 攻擊力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>並<#ef5350ff>沉默<>目標<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>。同時獲得<#ff9028ff>勇氣<>：<#ffb900ff>2秒<>內受到的傷害降低<#ffb900ff>30%<>、韌性提高<#ffb900ff>60%<>，並獲得<#e8d44dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>6% 最大生命值<>的<#e8d44dff>護盾<>。",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>審判<>：蓋倫揮劍旋轉<#ffb900ff>3秒<>，可以邊轉邊移動，共轉<#ffb900ff>7<>圈，每圈對周圍敵人造成<#ff9028ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>32% 攻擊力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>。第<#ffb900ff>7<>圈命中的敵人<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>護甲<>降低<#ffb900ff>25%<>，持續<#ffb900ff>4秒<>。被動 <#ff9028ff>堅韌<>：蓋倫擁有很高的<#6aff55ff>生命回復<>。",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>德瑪西亞正義<>：召喚巨劍從天而降，對目標敵方英雄造成<#f5f5f5ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120% 攻擊力<> + <#f5f5f5ff>12% 目標最大生命值<>的<#f5f5f5ff>真實傷害<>。"
      }
    },
    "skill_name": {
      "league_garen": {
        "skill1": "致命打擊",
        "skill2": "審判",
        "ult": "德瑪西亞正義"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_garen": {
        "name": "Garen",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Decisive Strike<>: Garen gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>35% movement speed<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. His next basic attack within <#ffb900ff>4.5s<> becomes a leaping strike that deals <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#ef5350ff>silences<> the target for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. He also gains <#ff9028ff>Courage<>: <#ffb900ff>30%<> damage reduction and <#ffb900ff>60%<> tenacity for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, plus a <#e8d44dff>shield<> of <#e8d44dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>6% max health<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Judgment<>: Garen spins his sword for <#ffb900ff>3s<> and can move while spinning. Each of the <#ffb900ff>7<> spins deals <#ff9028ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>32% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to nearby enemies; the <#ffb900ff>7th<> spin lowers their <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>armor<> by <#ffb900ff>25%<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Perseverance<>: Garen has very high <#6aff55ff>health regeneration<>.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>Demacian Justice<>: Calls a giant sword down on the target enemy champion, dealing <#f5f5f5ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120% AD<> + <#f5f5f5ff>12% of its max health<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>."
      }
    },
    "skill_name": {
      "league_garen": {
        "skill1": "Decisive Strike",
        "skill2": "Judgment",
        "ult": "Demacian Justice"
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_garen": {
        "name": "가렌",
        "attack": "기본 공격은 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 100%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>를 줍니다.",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>결정타<>: 가렌이 <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> 동안 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>이동 속도가 35%<> 증가합니다. <#ffb900ff>4.5초<> 안의 다음 기본 공격은 도약 강타가 되어 <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 150%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>를 주고 대상을 <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> 동안 <#ef5350ff>침묵<>시킵니다. 또한 <#ff9028ff>용기<>를 얻어 <#ffb900ff>2초<> 동안 받는 피해가 <#ffb900ff>30%<> 감소하고 강인함이 <#ffb900ff>60%<> 증가하며, <#e8d44dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>최대 체력의 6%<>의 <#e8d44dff>보호막<>을 얻습니다.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>심판<>: 가렌이 <#ffb900ff>3초<> 동안 검을 휘두르며 회전하고, 회전 중에도 이동할 수 있습니다. <#ffb900ff>7<>번의 회전마다 주변 적에게 <#ff9028ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 32%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>를 주며, <#ffb900ff>7<>번째 회전은 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>방어력<>을 <#ffb900ff>4초<> 동안 <#ffb900ff>25%<> 낮춥니다. 기본 지속 효과 <#ff9028ff>인내<>: 가렌은 <#6aff55ff>체력 재생<>이 매우 높습니다.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>데마시아의 정의<>: 대상 적 챔피언에게 거대한 검을 내리꽂아 <#f5f5f5ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 120%<> + <#f5f5f5ff>대상 최대 체력의 12%<> <#f5f5f5ff>고정 피해<>를 줍니다."
      }
    },
    "skill_name": {
      "league_garen": {
        "skill1": "결정타",
        "skill2": "심판",
        "ult": "데마시아의 정의"
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_garen": {
        "name": "ガレン",
        "attack": "通常攻撃は<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の100%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>を与える。",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>断固たる一撃<>：ガレンは<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>間<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移動速度が35%<>増加する。<#ffb900ff>4.5秒<>以内の次の通常攻撃は跳躍斬りになり、<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の150%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>を与えて対象を<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>間<#ef5350ff>サイレンス<>状態にする。さらに<#ff9028ff>勇気<>を得て、<#ffb900ff>2秒<>間受けるダメージが<#ffb900ff>30%<>減少し、行動妨害耐性が<#ffb900ff>60%<>増加し、<#e8d44dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>最大体力の6%<>の<#e8d44dff>シールド<>を得る。",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>審判<>：ガレンは<#ffb900ff>3秒<>間剣を振り回して回転し、回転中も移動できる。<#ffb900ff>7<>回の回転ごとに周囲の敵に<#ff9028ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の32%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>を与え、<#ffb900ff>7<>回目の回転は<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>物理防御<>を<#ffb900ff>4秒<>間<#ffb900ff>25%<>低下させる。自動効果 <#ff9028ff>忍耐<>：ガレンは非常に高い<#6aff55ff>体力自動回復<>を持つ。",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>デマーシアの正義<>：対象の敵チャンピオンに巨大な剣を落とし、<#f5f5f5ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の120%<> + <#f5f5f5ff>対象の最大体力の12%<>の<#f5f5f5ff>確定ダメージ<>を与える。"
      }
    },
    "skill_name": {
      "league_garen": {
        "skill1": "断固たる一撃",
        "skill2": "審判",
        "ult": "デマーシアの正義"
      }
    }
  }
}
